  "scope_notes": [
    "No Major correctness finding in all 26 reviewed records, including completed screen 05 and three-repeat confirmation 06.",
    "Current regression source covers SAFE/CEX/no-assert with clocked assertions; tests were inspected, not executed in this audit. It does not itself test BOUNDED classification or assumption preservation, so those are only supported here by actual logs/code inspection.",
    "Native FIFO proof covers all assertions enabled by the selected configuration, not the five cover goals or every upstream parameter variant. Constant-A assertion cells remain counted in 28.",
    "Per-task seconds stop before final artifact hashing and result.json reporting; those costs and source download/tool identity are in suite_seconds. This timer boundary differs from fixed-pair prove_rtl timings.",
    "This is exploratory B0 screening and three fresh-process confirmations on one host, not an abstraction speedup experiment, production certificate acceptance, or current frozen port-property proof.",
    "No zero-fill was added: synchronous FIFO initializes only mem[0]; remaining memory initial bits stay unconstrained. Postprep FF bits include formal-monitor state and exclude memory-array bits.",
    "async2sync is appropriate for these single-positive-clock synchronous FIFO inputs and clocked checks; this review does not qualify it for arbitrary asynchronous/multiclock designs."
